      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-08T21:56:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We\u0027re mutating a string that is shared with `CFStringCreateWithBytesNoCopy`, which may be problematic (or not, not sure if documented).  Since we don\u0027t need `str` beyond tokenization, I suggest we `CFRelease(str);` immediately after the `Tokenize` call, to be on the safe side.",
      "revId": "1aa337c49a1cab965512435835507b9a4105021b",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
